\"brand name\">Chef Llama</p>\n<p class=\"footer__note\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"recipe generation disclaimer\">Recipes are generated by a small model. Check ingredients and allergens yourself.</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Legal\" class=\"footer__links\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer legal links navigation\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"terms link\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a>\n<a data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"privacy link\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<fieldset class=\"scheme\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"theme switch control\">\n<legend data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"theme switch label\">Appearance</legend>\n<div class=\"switch\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"theme options container\">\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"system theme option\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"system theme radio input\" id=\"scheme-system\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"system\"/><span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"system theme label\">System</span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"light theme option\"><input data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"light theme radio input\" id=\"scheme-light\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"light\"/><span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"light theme label\">Light</span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"dark theme option\"><input data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"dark theme radio input\" id=\"scheme-dark\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"dark\"/><span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"dark theme label\">Dark</span></label>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>\n",
