bel\">Saves</span></span></span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"recipe card list item 4\">\n<a class=\"card\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 (roast squash and chickpeas)\" href=\"/recipes/roast-squash-chickpeas\">\n<span class=\"card__rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"recipe card rank 4\">4</span>\n<span class=\"card__body\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 body\">\n<span class=\"card__title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 title\">Roast squash and chickpeas</span>\n<span class=\"card__ings\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 ingredients\">butternut squash, chickpeas, cumin, yoghurt</span>\n<span class=\"card__meta\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 stats row\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 stat: cook time\"><span class=\"card__fig\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 cook time figure\">40 min</span><span class=\"card__unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 cook time unit label\">Cook</span></span><span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 stat: kcal\"><span class=\"card__fig\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 kcal figure\">445 kcal</span><span class=\"card__unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 kcal unit label\">Per serving</span></span><span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 stat: saves\"><span class=\"card__fig\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 saves figure\">29</span><span class=\"card__unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-4-1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"recipe card 4 saves unit label\">Saves</span></span></span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"recipe card list item 5\">\n<a class=\"card\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"recipe card 5 (braised leeks on toast)\" href=\"/recipes/braised-leeks\">